flowchart TD
    R[Request] --> K{System One available?}
    K -->|yes| C[choice: which procedure, or none]
    K -->|yes| N[noul: is each tool needed?]
    K -->|no| V[Vector search, one sentence at a time]
    C --> P[Tools named in the chosen procedure]
    N --> T[Tools above the threshold]
    P --> B[Bound for this turn]
    T --> B
    V --> B
    A[Always bound: load_skill, remember_fact, scratch_note] --> B
